* Fresh Xschem-generated 4-bit CMOS adder test
.lib "sky130.lib.spice" tt
** sch_path: ./xschem/four_bit_adder/four_bit_adder.sch
**.subckt four_bit_adder A0 B0 Cin vdd A1 B1 A2 B2 A3 B3 S0 S1 S2 S3 Cout
*.ipin A0
*.ipin B0
*.ipin Cin
*.ipin vdd
*.ipin A1
*.ipin B1
*.ipin A2
*.ipin B2
*.ipin A3
*.ipin B3
*.opin S0
*.opin S1
*.opin S2
*.opin S3
*.opin Cout
XFA0 A0 B0 Cin S0 C1 vdd CMOS_FULL_ADDER
XFA1 A1 B1 C1 S1 C2 vdd CMOS_FULL_ADDER
XFA2 A2 B2 C2 S2 C3 vdd CMOS_FULL_ADDER
XFA3 A3 B3 C3 S3 Cout vdd CMOS_FULL_ADDER
**.ends

